  {
    "id": "2223750",
    "original": "フランツ・リストの最も有名な作品は19のハンガリー狂詩曲だが、彼は他にもソナタ、交響曲、協奏曲、歌曲、宗教曲など見事な作品を生み出した。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "2725626",
        "text": "The best-known compositions by Franz Liszt are his nineteen Hungarian Rhapsodies, but he also created beautiful sonatas, symphonies, concerti, songs, and religious compositions."
